{"id": "2eae7cb5-8597-4e2c-b963-0a1bf3c967ba", "slug": "nexus-core", "title": "Nexus \\ Core", "description": "Nexus Core Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus \\\\ Core\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Core Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#CCFF00\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#CCFF00\"\n  background: \"#CCFF00\"\n  surface: \"#333333\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#333333\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"ui-sans-serif\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"ui-sans-serif\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus \\ Core\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 7; favorites: 1; remixes: 4.\nTags: onboarding, animated, webgl, threejs, navigation, links, flow, effect.\n## Overview\nNexus Core Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nnexus SYSTEMS 3 LABORATORY TRANSMISSIONS 9 INITIATE Nexus \\Core Next-generation architectures that process, adapt and dominate. . // 45.92° // 12.04° // 88.31° 250+ Executing precision algorithms globally A technology c…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Nexus \\Core; Next-generation architectures that process, adapt and dominate. ..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #CCFF00, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #CCFF00, background #CCFF00, surface #333333, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse ui-sans-serif for display moments and ui-sans-serif for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased selection:bg-[#ccff00] selection:text-black\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus \\ Core</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- Three.js for WebGL -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- GSAP for Animations -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Base specific overrides and custom patterns */\n        body {\n            background-color: #050505;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        /* Subtle diagonal background texture */\n        .bg-texture {\n            position: fixed;\n            inset: 0;\n            z-index: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n                -45deg,\n                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01) 0,\n                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01) 1px,\n                transparent 1px,\n                transparent 10px\n            );\n        }\n\n        /* Premium Border Gradients */\n        .gradient-border-container {\n            position: relative;\n            background: #0a0a0a;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n        .gradient-border-container::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            padding: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.4), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.1));\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Minimal scrollbar */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #050505; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #333; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #555; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen text-white/80 overflow-hidden font-sans\">\n\n    <!-- Subtle Background Texture -->\n    <div class=\"bg-texture\"></div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Layer (Sits behind text like the reference image) -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none w-full h-full object-cover\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Framed Grid Layout & Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-4 sm:inset-6 z-0 pointer-events-none border border-white/10 flex\">\n        <!-- Vertical guide lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[15%] top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute right-[25%] top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n        <!-- Horizontal guide lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[20%] left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[25%] left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Mini corner squares (Top Left, Top Right, Bottom Left, Bottom Right) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[2px] -left-[2px] w-1 h-1 bg-white/30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[2px] -right-[2px] w-1 h-1 bg-white/30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[2px] -left-[2px] w-1 h-1 bg-white/30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[2px] -right-[2px] w-1 h-1 bg-white/30\"></div>\n\n        <!-- L-shaped corner brackets (Frame emphasis) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 w-4 h-[1px] bg-white/20 -translate-x-full\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 h-4 w-[1px] bg-white/20 -translate-y-full\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-4 h-[1px] bg-white/20 translate-x-full\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 h-4 w-[1px] bg-white/20 translate-y-full\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Container (Overlays WebGL) -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-20 w-full h-screen flex flex-col justify-between p-6 sm:p-10 pointer-events-none\">\n\n        <!-- All interactive elements need pointer-events-auto -->\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"flex justify-between items-center w-full uppercase text-[0.65rem] tracking-widest pointer-events-auto\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-[#ccff00] text-sm\">\n                <span>nexus</span>\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ccff00]\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-start gap-0.5\">\n                    SYSTEMS <span class=\"text-[0.5rem] opacity-50 bg-white/10 px-1 rounded-sm\">3</span>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">LABORATORY</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-start gap-0.5\">\n                    TRANSMISSIONS <span class=\"text-[0.5rem] opacity-50 bg-white/10 px-1 rounded-sm\">9</span>\n                </a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#ccff00] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2\">\n                INITIATE\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-white/50\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Center Stage -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center -z-10 mt-10 sm:mt-0\">\n            <!-- Huge Title Layer (Sits behind the 3D object for depth overlap) -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-[12vw] sm:text-[10vw] font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-[0.85] text-center uppercase text-white drop-shadow-2xl\">\n                <span class=\"text-[#ccff00]\">Nexus</span><br class=\"sm:hidden\"/>\\Core\n            </h1>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Overlay Details Layer -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none\">\n\n            <!-- Middle Top Text -->\n            <div class=\"w-full flex justify-center pt-[15vh] sm:pt-[10vh]\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl text-white font-medium tracking-tight max-w-lg text-center leading-snug reveal-text drop-shadow-md\">\n                    Next-generation architectures that process, adapt and dominate.\n                    <span class=\"text-[#ccff00] text-3xl leading-none relative top-1\">.</span>\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Left Trackers (Vertical) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-6 sm:left-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col gap-16 sm:gap-32 text-[0.55rem] font-mono tracking-widest text-white/40\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n                    <span>// 45.92°</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n                    <span>// 12.04°</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n                    <span>// 88.31°</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Stats -->\n            <div class=\"absolute right-6 sm:right-10 top-[20vh] sm:top-[25vh] text-right\">\n                <div class=\"text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-semibold text-[#ccff00] tracking-tighter leading-none mb-2 reveal-text\">250+</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[0.6rem] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/60 max-w-[120px] sm:max-w-[150px] ml-auto leading-relaxed\">\n                    Executing precision algorithms globally\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Section Grid -->\n            <div class=\"w-full mt-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end gap-10 md:gap-0 pointer-events-auto\">\n\n                <!-- Bottom Left -->\n                <div class=\"max-w-sm flex flex-col gap-6\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[0.65rem] sm:text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-white/70 leading-loose reveal-text\">\n                        A technology collective trusted by hyper-growth startups and enterprise networks. <br/>\n                        We build infrastructure that scales.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 text-[0.6rem] font-mono text-white/40 border-t border-white/10 pt-4 w-fit\">\n                        <span>SYSTEM TIME 11:42:09 Z</span>\n                        <span>UTC+0 SERVER CLUSTER</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mt-2\">\n                        <button class=\"gradient-border-container px-6 py-3 text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors text-white flex items-center gap-2 group\">\n                            ACCESS GRID\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-[#ccff00] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-[#e5e5e5] text-black text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold hover:bg-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group\">\n                            CONNECT\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Right (Showreel) -->\n                <div class=\"w-full md:w-auto md:max-w-[320px] flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[0.55rem] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 mb-1\">\n                        <span>SIMULATION</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 h-[1px] bg-white/10 mx-4\"></div>\n                        <span>\\\\V.04</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Thumbnail Container with border gradient -->\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border-container aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer relative\">\n                        <!-- Abstract CSS Pattern Placeholder imitating 3D curves -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0a0a0a] z-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-30\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 150%, rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.4) 0%, transparent 50%);\"></div>\n                            <!-- Wavy lines simulation -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-center gap-[2px] opacity-40 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity scale-110 group-hover:scale-100 duration-700\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-[#ccff00] rounded-[100%] scale-x-150 translate-y-[-20px]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-white rounded-[100%] scale-x-150 translate-y-[-10px]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-white rounded-[100%] scale-x-150\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-[#ccff00] rounded-[100%] scale-x-150 translate-y-[10px]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-white rounded-[100%] scale-x-150 translate-y-[20px]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Play Icon Overlay -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-10\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-black/50 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-[#ccff00]/20 group-hover:border-[#ccff00]/50 transition-colors\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-white ml-0.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[0.55rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 mt-1\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cup-star-linear\" width=\"12\" class=\"text-[#ccff00] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <p>AWARDED PLATFORM OF THE YEAR, TECH INNOVATION SUMMIT</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- 1. WebGL 3D Object Setup (Three.js) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera setup with perspective\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 30;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({\n                canvas,\n                alpha: true,\n                antialias: true,\n                powerPreference: \"high-performance\"\n            });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            // Create a faceted, geometric mesh (Icosahedron)\n            const geometry = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(12, 1); // Radius 12, Detail 1 (creates facets)\n\n            // Physically-based material for premium look\n            const material = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\n                color: 0x111111,          // Very dark base\n                metalness: 0.9,           // Highly metallic\n                roughness: 0.15,          // Slightly glossy\n                clearcoat: 1.0,           // Extra shine layer\n                clearcoatRoughness: 0.1,\n                flatShading: true,        // Emphasizes the geometric edges\n                emissive: 0x0a0a0a,       // Slight base glow\n                wireframe: false\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            // Inner wireframe for tech aesthetic\n            const wireMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0xccff00, wireframe: true, transparent: true, opacity: 0.1 });\n            const wireMesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, wireMaterial);\n            wireMesh.scale.set(1.02, 1.02, 1.02); // Slightly larger\n            scene.add(wireMesh);\n\n            // Dynamic Lighting\n            const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.5);\n            scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n            // Main accent light (Neon color)\n            const dirLight1 = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xccff00, 3);\n            dirLight1.position.set(10, 20, 10);\n            scene.add(dirLight1);\n\n            // Secondary cool light for contrast\n            const dirLight2 = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0x00aaff, 1.5);\n            dirLight2.position.set(-10, -20, 10);\n            scene.add(dirLight2);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Subtle rotation\n                mesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.1;\n                mesh.rotation.x = elapsedTime * 0.05;\n                wireMesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.1;\n                wireMesh.rotation.x = elapsedTime * 0.05;\n\n                // Floating motion (sine wave on Y axis)\n                mesh.position.y = Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.5) * 1.5;\n                wireMesh.position.y = Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.5) * 1.5;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // --- 2. GSAP Masked Reveal Setup ---\n        const initGSAP = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Utility to wrap words for masked animation\n            const textElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text');\n\n            textElements.forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                // Avoid messing with nested HTML if present, simpler split for text-only elements\n                if (el.children.length === 0 || el.querySelector('span')) {\n                    // Manual crude wrapping to preserve existing basic spans like the dot\n                    const htmlContent = el.innerHTML;\n                    // Only apply to elements without complex inner HTML to avoid breaking structure\n                    if(!htmlContent.includes('<span class=\"text-[#ccff00]')) {\n                         const words = text.split(' ');\n                         el.innerHTML = words.map(word =>\n                            `<span style=\"display:inline-flex; overflow:hidden; vertical-align:top; margin-right:0.2em; padding-bottom:0.1em;\"><span class=\"reveal-word\" style=\"display:inline-block; transform:translateY(110%);\">${word}</span></span>`\n                         ).join(' ');\n                    } else {\n                        // For the specific top text with a styled span dot, wrap whole line\n                         el.innerHTML = `<span style=\"display:inline-flex; overflow:hidden; vertical-align:top; padding-bottom:0.1em;\"><span class=\"reveal-word\" style=\"display:inline-block; transform:translateY(110%);\">${el.innerHTML}</span></span>`;\n                    }\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Animate on load\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                gsap.to('.reveal-word', {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    duration: 1,\n                    ease: 'power4.out',\n                    stagger: 0.04,\n                    opacity: 1\n                });\n\n                // Animate background elements subtly\n                gsap.fromTo('.gradient-border-container',\n                    { opacity: 0, y: 20 },\n                    { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1, ease: 'power3.out', stagger: 0.2, delay: 0.5 }\n                );\n            }, 100); // Slight delay to ensure render\n        };\n\n        // Initialize everything\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initGSAP();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-core.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-core.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-core-DESIGN.md", "views": 177, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-04-29T00:44:46.434433+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T19:15:01.93232+00:00"}